  "_about": "Bildkarten (/wissen/bildwoerterbuch): 100 important English words as picture cards, like a children's memory game but with nothing on the back. Re-keyed 2026-10-30 (vocab-a1) from the German set (chosen 2026-10-14 by German frequency) to the English A1 lexicon: the same pictures with their English words, little words without a clear English match dropped (an, aus, um, nach, durch, woher, wohin, gegen, oben) and nine more food and kitchen nouns that already had a drawing added. Re-pick by English frequency once the A1 ranks are attached (scripts/attach-ranks.mjs). 39 nouns, 20 verbs, 20 adjectives, 21 little words. `id` is the lexicon id: article, audio and translations come from there. `drawings` maps an id to its drawing in src/lib/bildwoerter.js (src/lib/bildkarten/), whose names are still the German ones. `merch`: the ten motifs on /merch, picked for what sells on a mug, not by rank.",
